# AskSage Proof Agent - build-context exclusions.
# Only what Dockerfile.app COPYs is needed in the image: requirements.txt,
# dashboard.py, wsgi.py, app.py, src/, configs/, assets/.
# The rest (models, llama.cpp source, venv, tests, docs) would otherwise be
# sent to the Docker daemon as build context.

# Heavy / machine-specific
.venv/
llama.cpp/
models/
data/
.git/

# Python noise
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc

# Local scratch
_chrome_tmp/
_edge_tmp/
.omo/
.dsh-project-summaries/

# Not copied by the image; excluded to keep context small
docs/
tests/
tools/
*.md
*.ps1
*.sh
.env
test_*.py
qa_probe.py
Modelfile